    "All 146 prior path source records and 126 public route assets, all catalog mileages, and all gauge/timing models are unchanged. No new GPS ETA, calculator-distance adoption or land-overlay filtering is enabled.",
    "Four lower Wisconsin and three upper St. Croix sections have reviewed endpoints but the current named-river geometry remains over 100 m from a landing. Review missing side-channel connections instead of moving pins or relaxing endpoint tolerances.",
    "Sixty-seven Wisconsin maps remain held; 265 available Wisconsin maps still lack a dotted path. The remaining-work file records the evidence needed for each held map."
